      "expr" = "m['whzAshLightFarAccumInches']() >= m['whzAshLightNearAccumInches']() or m['whzAshLightNearAccumInches']() >= m['whzAshHeavyNearAccumInches']()",
    }, {
      "note" = "the cloudkill hit-die bands abut: fewer than 8+1 slain, 8+1 through 10+1 saving at -4, 11 and above saving normally",
